                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a Board Certified Family Nurse Practitioner and Board Certified Psychiatric Mental Health Nurse Practitioner with over 30 years in healthcare, I know firsthand the heart, strength, and sacrifice this calling requires. On #NationalNursesDay, I\u2019m proud to stand with my fellow nurses and thank each of you for the care you give our communities every single day. \ud83d\udc99",
