                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On Memorial Day, we remember those who paid the ultimate price \u2014 and we honor them by caring for those who made it home.\n\nThat\u2019s why I introduced the Veterans Life Insurance Expansion & Integrity Act \u2014 a no-cost solution to ensure every veteran under 81 can access the VA life insurance they deserve.\n\nBecause service doesn\u2019t end with the uniform. Neither should our support. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nRead my full release here: https://t.co/mo1RfF0euN",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
