                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I recently joined my House colleagues for a productive meeting with @DrOzCMS to discuss the Trump Administration\u2019s push to put patients first in healthcare.\n\nWe\u2019re focused on expanding access, cutting red tape, and delivering better care for hardworking Americans. Proud to support this important effort. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
