                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was a joy to visit Morningside of Anderson and spend time with the incredible residents and dedicated staff at this wonderful assisted living community.\n\nWith over 30 years in health care, from ICU nurse to nursing home administrator, caring for others has always been close to my heart. \ud83d\udc99",
