                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats are threatening a government shutdown to force through a radical wish list: things like free healthcare for illegal immigrants, taxpayer-funded transgender surgeries for minors, and billions in fraud and waste.\n\nI spoke with @NEWSMAX about how I\u2019m standing strong, just like President Trump, to keep the government open, secure our border, and stop this insanity. The American people deserve better. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
