                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I spoke with our local veterans to talk through how the Democrat-led shutdown could impact their benefits, healthcare, and support services. These heroes should never be caught in the middle of Washington\u2019s dysfunction.\n\nIf you or your family are having issues with a federal agency during the shutdown, please reach out; my office is here to help.\n\n\ud83d\udcde (864) 224-7401\n\ud83d\udcbbhttps://t.co/XeVU5ksMOY",
