                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "UPDATE: The two National Guardsman that were tragically shot in Washington today have been confirmed by the FBI and federal authorities to be in critical condition and remain under close watch by medical professionals. Previous reporting was conflicted on the ground, but our heroic federal law enforcement are now leading the investigation. Let us all pray for the victims\u2019 health and for their families.",
