                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Every life matters. I took to the House floor to speak about the heartbreaking rise in suicides in Anderson County, and elsewhere, and the urgent need to take mental health seriously.\n\nThis is particularly important and challenging around the holiday season. Don\u2019t be afraid to ask the hard questions. Reach out to those you care about, let them know they\u2019re not alone and they are loved.\n\nAs a nurse practitioner, a mother, and a servant of this community, I will always fight for those suffering in silence. You are not alone.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
